== Trivia ==
* {{i|Roid Rage}} describes the frequent anger outbursts induced by the overuse of steroids.
* The item's name and effects is from another one of Edmund's games known as ''The C Word''.<ref>[https://web.archive.org/web/20140803181618/http://edmundm.com/post/93130816520/is-the-roid-rage-item-in-isaac-a-reference-to-that Edmund's blog which he answered a question relating to the item.]</ref>
* Prior to Repentance, {{i|Roid Rage}} was the biggest speed upgrade in the game with the title now going to {{I|Mercurius}} with its +0.4 speed, which is still 33% smaller.

